{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118987","id":3586728747,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7VySMr","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118987","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118987.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118987.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118987","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118987/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118987/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118987/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/14f183b2b4eea56e3f77dff5a6d623e1cb651ee8","number":118987,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Simplify array property parsing","user":{"login":"TastiestLemon","id":137527931,"node_id":"U_kgDOCDKCew","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137527931?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TastiestLemon","html_url":"https://github.com/TastiestLemon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TastiestLemon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TastiestLemon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TastiestLemon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TastiestLemon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TastiestLemon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TastiestLemon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TastiestLemon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TastiestLemon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TastiestLemon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I'm working on a [separate change](https://github.com/TastiestLemon/godot/pull/1) that adds a new `PropertyHint` to the `EditorPropertyArray`.\r\nIn doing so, I found a lot of duplicated logic that wasn't too easy to follow. Since my other change is a bit niche and may not be merged, I figured it'd be best to move the refactoring to its own file, as I do think these changes just make the code more elegant to look through, and make it easier for other people to add new `PropertyHint`s to the array (or dictionary) in the future.\r\n\r\nThere was also a slight fix to `button_add_item->set_visible(page_index == max_page);`, where this line was occasionally being used in a case where `button_add_item` wasn't initialized, leading to dereferencing a nullptr.\r\nI could move this to another branch if preferred, it was just a small thing I added while touching everything else that still felt somewhat relevant to these changes. (plus my other change that adds a new `PropertyHint` modifies `button_add_item`, so I'm figuring I either fix it in this branch or my other one)\r\n\r\nOther than moving `button_add_item`, this branch has no behavioral changes.\r\n(or I hope so at least, please let me know if there's something I missed 😅)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com